# The drum drift's settings stay when the piece or the genre changes; the JAM page takes the voice it plays off its line (and gives it back);
# the mood reaches the pluck. (Parameters: 94 drum drift Change, 122 the pluck's hand switch, 111 acid hand.)
seed 0
wait 3000
turn SELECT 19 100
expect view 19
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect par94 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 300
expect par94 1
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect par94 1
# JAM, the pluck: its line stops while the page is up, and is back when it is left
tap HOME
wait 100
expect enpar122 0
tap GLO
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
expect view 27
expect jamv 0
wait 100
expect enpar122 1
expect par122 0
tap HOME
wait 200
expect enpar122 0
